        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion D6, Scroll Grab Victorian Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith ornate designs on both the plates and the handle, this Scroll Grab handleset emulates old world beauty. The intricate scrolling detail of this Fusion made handleset adds an elegance instead of gaudiness. Available in 5 finishes, this solid brass Victorian Handleset will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Ornate Solid Brass Fusion D6 Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass forging and casting.</li>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist that eliminates \"knob wobble\".</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion D6 Victorian Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Height: 17-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Width: 3-1/3\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Height 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2 on center door boring</li>\r\n<li>Center of latch bore to center of bottom thrubolt for handle:  7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
